%% Subscription tiers and entitlements resolution
%% Status: current | Related: docs/product/tier-matrix.md
flowchart TD
  Request[API request for tenant] --> ResolveBilling[resolveOrgBillingTenantId\nbranch uses parent org subscription]
  ResolveBilling --> Sub[getTenantSubscription]
  Sub --> PlanRow[subscription_plan\nfree | silver | gold | platinum | enterprise]
  PlanRow --> Limits[plan.limits JSON]
  PlanRow --> Features[plan.features JSON]
  Limits --> TenantOv{tenant_limit_override?}
  TenantOv -->|increase only| EffLimit[effective limit]
  Limits --> PlanOv{plan_limit_override?}
  PlanOv --> EffLimit
  Limits --> Addon[tenant_subscription_addon\nbranches / warehouses]
  Addon --> EffLimit
  EffLimit --> Usage[usage_meter + live counts]
  Features --> FeatOv[feature_flag_override\ntenant → global → plan]
  FeatOv --> Gate[requireFeature / requireWithinLimit]
  BronzeLegacy[API input bronze] --> Normalize[normalizePlanCode → silver]
  Normalize --> PlanRow
  Enterprise[enterprise plan] --> AdminOnly[requires_admin_assignment\nno self-serve]
